attn.core: 12.198 -> 9.679 ms (-2.519, -20.7%). The untraced wall falls 4.26 ms/token, more than
the traced attention delta because the trace's per-call overhead inflates the attribution; the
paired untraced delta is (3.6507-3.0693)/128 = 4.54 ms/token.

