  $ env APEIRON_THREADS=8 APEIRON_KV_CARRIER=f32 phase_split --model ... --pack ... \
      --steps 32 --prefix 1795 --target attn.core
  TARGET attn.core: share 43.2%, ceiling 1.76x
  exit 0

## Probe: the same arithmetic, tile-outer vs head-outer

/tmp/attn_group_probe.rs (standalone, not in the tree): one layer's K/V plane, 8 KV heads,
4 q heads, head_dim 128, stride 1024, 1,828 positions, single thread, best of 40:

head (per-head calls, current shape): 34.237 ns/head-position, 7.5 GB/s once-read
group (tile-outer, heads-inner):     23.432 ns/head-position, 10.9 GB/s once-read
max|a-b| = 0 (bit-identical outputs)

The probe's ratio 1.46 isolates the locality effect; in the engine the tile's second-order
effects (pool dispatch, trace) put the wall ratio at 1.19.

